# Runtime state, not source: cached gov.uk pages, the source-health ledger and
# the human's acknowledgements. src/sources.py recreates these directories on
# demand, so a fresh clone works with none of it present. Committing them would
# also freeze a snapshot of the very pages this agent exists to re-check.
data/

# Private working notes, kept local. This repository is public: it carries the
# deliverable, not the author's planning. These files hold personal scheduling
# and commitments to unrelated projects that have no business being published.
CLAUDE.md
FOCUS.md
docs/


# Lambda deployment artefacts, rebuilt by scripts/build_lambda.sh
build/
